      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can you describe the \"invite yourself glitch\"? Being able to invite yourself via the VRChat Home website and launch links is intended. Getting into an instance in this way doesn't permit you to bypass the normal user limit.\nRemember that the displayed capacity is the \"soft cap\" of a room. You can actually fit 2x the number of the soft cap (aka, the \"hard cap\") before you start getting \"the room is full\" messages on join.\nAs an example, Spookyghostboo's The Black Cat has a capacity (or \"soft cap\") of 18. However, with a link to the instance (or by joining off friends), you can fit up to 36 people in the instance before additional joiners start getting \"the instance is full\" messages.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
